This might be actually a good game if weren`t for these particular reasons:
* "ice-slide" walking mechanic;
* no real tutorial;
* in the beggining of the game some boxes drop on you (wtf?);
* bad placed traps (I literally fall in same place, no matter what I do)
* background picture and music are too creepy for this kind of platformer;
(The game is not even horror, don`t believe me? Check out the user tags!);
* there`s no specification of health or lives;
* there`s no keyboard customization;
* in the menu there`s cleary specified "controller" but there`s no controller support,
only for keyboard;
* lack of proper capitalization in start menu and "controller" screen;
* start screen takes too much to load for a game as small as this one;
* finally but not last: price. For a game such as this 4$ is NOT WORTH IT!
I`m really glad I actually got this game for free as a bundle with other games made by same indie company!
And yes I played only 10 minutes, since I couldn`t even finish the first level where the tutorial should had been.
You simply CAN`T just trow the player right into the lion`s mouth without teaching him the basic gameplay! Esspecially if you guys are yourself gamers! You played or should had played games made by other indie companies, you shold know how a game is proper made!
And this is anything but that!
If the price was let`s say 1$ or even free, maybe it was forgivable but not at 4$!
With 4$ I can buy tripple AAA games that are 500% better than yours!
I really hope this game and the rest of your games are not actually just some cash-grabs!

Microtransaction Simulator is a Free game that is a simple graphically ugly parody of  a clicker game.  It worked on Win 10, looked ok, played ok, sounded ok.  It has a background track that is horendous and you can mute it.  It has Steam achievements, some that are easy and some that require hacking to get.  It has very simple graphics.  You can buy cards while in debt.  You can waste your cards by hitting the open button or other buttons before you have clicked your cards.  There is no tutorial, help, instructions. The Trophy button Resets the game. There is no ads or ways of monetizing for the Devs in this game.  Mostly, a waste of time game.  Check the guides for how to get all the steam achievements.
Try it, get the Steam achievements and delete it.
